#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:2 aca5249ba277455eaf7eb61ad0a9a08d
msgid "Basics & Visualization"
msgstr "基础与可视化"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:4 1ae4e15a64ae4e00bade4bd633b3a91c
msgid "Open in Colab"
msgstr "在 Colab 中打开"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:8 965826cd26fe4f88bf332cdd75d711e4
msgid ""
"Four short scripts in ``examples/basics/`` that visualize the building "
"blocks of FEM in TensorMesh: where interpolation nodes sit on the "
"reference element, what the shape functions look like, how internal node "
"numbering compares to Gmsh / VTK, and what the mesh generators produce. "
"None of these scripts solve a PDE — they exist to make the underlying "
"objects tangible and to sanity-check the conventions used elsewhere in "
"the library."
msgstr ""
"``examples/basics/`` 中有四个简短脚本，用于可视化 TensorMesh "
"中有限元方法的基础构件：插值节点在参考单元上的分布位置、形函数的形态、内部节点编号与 Gmsh / VTK "
"编号的对比，以及网格生成器的产物。这些脚本都不求解偏微分方程——它们的作用是让底层对象变得直观可见，并对库中其他地方使用的约定进行合理性检查。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:16 2d5027986e284bdb8bd1d8a8e4156d9a
msgid ""
"If you are reading this page after the "
":doc:`../user_guide/elements_and_quadrature` user-guide page, treat these"
" scripts as the picture book that goes with it."
msgstr ""
"如果你是在阅读 :doc:`../user_guide/elements_and_quadrature` "
"用户指南页面之后才来到本页，可以把这些脚本当作与之配套的图册。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:22 1e25a46e2a274c9aaf6ff2ad8d1c647f
msgid "Interpolation nodes"
msgstr "插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:24 37f34e11e38340ca8c3354b51f8a37f5
msgid ""
"``examples/basics/basis.py`` plots the spatial distribution of "
"interpolation (Lagrange) nodes on the reference element for all seven "
"element classes — :class:`~tensormesh.Line`, "
":class:`~tensormesh.Triangle`, :class:`~tensormesh.Quadrilateral`, "
":class:`~tensormesh.Tetrahedron`, :class:`~tensormesh.Hexahedron`, "
":class:`~tensormesh.Pyramid`, :class:`~tensormesh.Prism` — at orders 1 "
"through 4. The driver is a one-liner per element class:"
msgstr ""
"``examples/basics/basis.py`` 绘制全部七种单元类——:class:`~tensormesh.Line`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~tensormesh.Triangle`\\ 、\\ :class:`~tensormesh.Quadrilateral`\\ "
"、\\ :class:`~tensormesh.Tetrahedron`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~tensormesh.Hexahedron`\\ 、\\ :class:`~tensormesh.Pyramid`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~tensormesh.Prism`——在 1 至 4 "
"阶下，参考单元上插值（拉格朗日）节点的空间分布。每个单元类的驱动代码只有一行："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:32 d7186df396c54d759a804d862995b91f
msgid "examples/basics/basis.py (essence)"
msgstr "examples/basics/basis.py（核心）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:46 e8e59852a95348298c0294bbb419af97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The number of basis points grows quickly with order: :math:`(p+1)^d` for "
"tensor elements, :math:`\\binom{p+d}{d}` for simplex elements. Knowing "
"where they sit is the first sanity check when something goes wrong with a"
" higher-order solve."
msgstr ""
"基函数节点的数量随阶数迅速增长：张量单元为 :math:`(p+1)^d`\\ ，单纯形单元为 :math:`\\binom{p+d}{d}`\\"
" 。当高阶求解出现问题时，了解这些节点的位置是首要的合理性检查。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:52 3d7baefe075941b99b8ef1f968709aa0
msgid ""
"The seven panels below show the Lagrange-node layout for every supported "
"element class at orders 1–4. Each panel reads left-to-right by order; "
"node indices match the internal ``element.get_basis(order)`` ordering."
msgstr ""
"下面七幅图展示了每种受支持单元类在 1–4 阶下的拉格朗日节点布局。每幅图按阶数从左到右排列；节点索引与内部 "
"``element.get_basis(order)`` 的编号一致。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:57 7ac2b1f93c48423c8ff3d32c4a829d6e
msgid "Line element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "线单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:61 f589fcf92f644b5f9d18dd0d216d796a
msgid "``Line`` element — lexicographic ordering on :math:`[0, 1]`."
msgstr "``Line`` 单元——在 :math:`[0, 1]` 上的字典序编号。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:63 d879183742984b6c8a11f701b9eefbca
msgid "Triangle element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "三角形单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:67 64714b3facc140daa4cb7d47aa80a8fe
msgid ""
"``Triangle`` element — simplex ordering with vertex nodes first, then "
"edge nodes, then interior nodes."
msgstr "``Triangle`` 单元——单纯形编号，先排顶点节点，再排边节点，最后排内部节点。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:70 4023f1e430bc4aa6a331683c7d4e7927
msgid "Quadrilateral element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "四边形单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:74 d1731a20cbdc486e964b87b63114f692
msgid "``Quadrilateral`` element — tensor-product Lagrange nodes."
msgstr "``Quadrilateral`` 单元——张量积拉格朗日节点。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:76 615942cae7b34cbbac8251a217a6bda8
msgid "Tetrahedron element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "四面体单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:80 1dd3891802bd4bd092a921ee78436362
msgid "``Tetrahedron`` element — 3D simplex."
msgstr "``Tetrahedron`` 单元——三维单纯形。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:82 39c749ea1f18418dbb6ee9fb22c94ef7
msgid "Hexahedron element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "六面体单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:86 12ae2223bc884da1b94d339b4e3cdc3f
msgid "``Hexahedron`` element — 3D tensor product."
msgstr "``Hexahedron`` 单元——三维张量积。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:88 295d62499f734657a467c897e086b983
msgid "Prism element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "三棱柱单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:92 002ba2bcd1474ed283dd0cf2a705c534
msgid "``Prism`` (wedge) element — triangle :math:`\\times` line."
msgstr "``Prism``\\ （楔形）单元——三角形 :math:`\\times` 线。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:94 1a96d00e94ef4f33afc1a3172781eef1
msgid "Pyramid element interpolation nodes"
msgstr "四棱锥单元插值节点"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:98 f560dfcba35846a3b831d86c0422a734
msgid "``Pyramid`` element — square base, apex at the top."
msgstr "``Pyramid`` 单元——方形底面，顶点在上方。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:102 bd5f9505514d4f15a55ba45544cbf084
msgid "Shape functions"
msgstr "形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:104 8a07a9b2fa4d4329aa88b15650390a4c
msgid ""
"``examples/basics/basis_fn.py`` plots the polynomial shape functions "
"themselves. For 1D elements they appear as curves on :math:`[-1,1]`; for "
"2D elements as 3D surfaces on the reference triangle or square; for 3D "
"elements one figure per order with a slice through the volume."
msgstr ""
"``examples/basics/basis_fn.py`` 绘制多项式形函数本身。对于一维单元，它们表现为 :math:`[-1,1]` "
"上的曲线；对于二维单元，表现为参考三角形或方形上的三维曲面；对于三维单元，每个阶数对应一幅图，并带有一个穿过体积的切片。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:110 7e85fea877df4de390da32e4eabb91f8
msgid ""
"The script uses ``element.get_basis_fns(order)``, the same call "
":class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` makes during assembly. If a shape "
"function looks wrong here, it is wrong in your assembled matrix too."
msgstr ""
"该脚本使用 ``element.get_basis_fns(order)``\\ ，这与 "
":class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` "
"在装配过程中所做的调用相同。如果某个形函数在这里看起来有误，那么它在你装配出的矩阵中同样有误。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:115 50f82ff4416f448d8eddd83c37832fd4
msgid ""
"In principle ``get_basis_fns`` accepts **arbitrary** polynomial order — "
"there is no hard cap baked into the API. The figures below show 1D and 2D"
" shape functions at orders 1–3 (plus the full composite view) and 3D "
"shape functions at order 1; higher 3D orders are equally available, they "
"are simply omitted here for space."
msgstr ""
"原则上 ``get_basis_fns`` 接受\\ **任意**\\ 多项式阶数——API 中并未内置硬性上限。下面的图展示了 1–3 "
"阶的一维和二维形函数（外加完整的合成视图），以及 1 阶的三维形函数；更高阶的三维形函数同样可用，这里仅出于篇幅原因略去。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:124 7f93fb12a6d84cfb997d8aa65d098e8d
msgid ""
"Although arbitrary orders are supported, very high orders (in practice "
":math:`\\geq 4` for some element classes) are evaluated through a "
"Vandermonde matrix that becomes increasingly ill-conditioned with order. "
"The script may print a numerical warning in that regime. The returned "
"values are still usable — but if you see those warnings during a real "
"solve, drop to a lower order or switch to a different element class. For "
"most FEM workloads orders 1–3 are the sweet spot."
msgstr ""
"虽然支持任意阶数，但很高的阶数（实际中某些单元类在 :math:`\\geq 4` "
"时）是通过范德蒙德（Vandermonde）矩阵求值的，而该矩阵随阶数升高会变得越来越病态。在此情形下脚本可能会打印数值警告。返回的值仍然可用——但如果你在真实求解过程中看到这些警告，请降低阶数或改用其他单元类。对于大多数有限元方法工作负载，1–3"
" 阶是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:135 ea87e2e2f36944f892dbee7a20afc3e8
msgid "1D and 2D shape functions"
msgstr "一维与二维形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:137 6ad8fa3a6c9e4a3a9e8b615e65bc7289
msgid "1D Lagrange shape functions at orders 1, 2, 3 plus composite"
msgstr "1、2、3 阶的一维拉格朗日形函数及合成视图"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:141 d56f127557154fc18a271c539796a798
msgid ""
"``Line`` shape functions at orders 1–3, plus a composite view of the "
"highest order. Stars mark the interpolation nodes."
msgstr "1–3 阶的 ``Line`` 形函数，以及最高阶的合成视图。星号标记插值节点。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:144 26849ad5928b4654a48b74e51d7995ae
msgid "Triangle shape function surfaces at orders 1, 2, 3"
msgstr "1、2、3 阶的三角形形函数曲面"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:148 a0793eea37a84c52bf55d7003d8842ed
msgid ""
"``Triangle`` shape functions plotted as 3D surfaces over the reference "
"triangle."
msgstr "``Triangle`` 形函数，以参考三角形上的三维曲面形式绘制。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:151 3117cbb3c3d748df8fef14e13f8d74f0
msgid "Quadrilateral shape function surfaces at orders 1, 2, 3"
msgstr "1、2、3 阶的四边形形函数曲面"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:155 913005baee2448afa0d80fb8da938bbd
msgid "``Quadrilateral`` shape functions on the reference square."
msgstr "参考方形上的 ``Quadrilateral`` 形函数。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:159 9f5871ac2f514f3f83c839de521cdbcb
msgid "3D shape functions (order 1)"
msgstr "三维形函数（1 阶）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:161 c427b9a2866f4cc893ca1f6b9c075ab5
msgid ""
"For 3D elements the script renders one volumetric figure per element / "
"order combination; only the order-1 panels are shown below. The full set "
"(including orders 2–4) lands in "
"``examples/basics/output/<element>/<order>.png`` after running the "
"script."
msgstr ""
"对于三维单元，脚本为每个单元 / 阶数组合渲染一幅体绘制图；下面仅展示 1 阶的图。运行脚本后，完整集合（包括 2–4 阶）会保存到 "
"``examples/basics/output/<element>/<order>.png``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:167 f3210458bcb241d8b0bc9b2cd8efadc4
msgid "Hexahedron order-1 shape functions"
msgstr "六面体 1 阶形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:171 5faddefc8e364ec685881788b39dbf11
msgid ""
"``Hexahedron`` order-1 shape functions — eight trilinear basis functions,"
" one per vertex."
msgstr "``Hexahedron`` 1 阶形函数——八个三线性基函数，每个顶点对应一个。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:174 f299a8c3463a417c83f47882227a7eff
msgid "Tetrahedron order-1 shape functions"
msgstr "四面体 1 阶形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:178 c245f29d07ac4b80bae61b69a018bdba
msgid "``Tetrahedron`` order-1 shape functions — four barycentric coordinates."
msgstr "``Tetrahedron`` 1 阶形函数——四个重心坐标。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:181 633c094dfdcd4c688020927e91d97207
msgid "Prism order-1 shape functions"
msgstr "三棱柱 1 阶形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:185 c09ff11929ba4bd3aaa0f3575e71ed27
msgid ""
"``Prism`` order-1 shape functions — six basis functions, one per vertex "
"of the triangular prism."
msgstr "``Prism`` 1 阶形函数——六个基函数，三棱柱每个顶点对应一个。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:188 5b81cf5faecf4b8fb942a2fc459a9588
msgid "Pyramid order-1 shape functions"
msgstr "四棱锥 1 阶形函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:192 0c356e98a74a4d3aa4e8ba90475bb305
msgid ""
"``Pyramid`` order-1 shape functions — five basis functions, one per "
"vertex."
msgstr "``Pyramid`` 1 阶形函数——五个基函数，每个顶点对应一个。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:199 ababcad1b7d74ae29f38558500216f56
msgid "Gmsh / VTK ↔ TensorMesh node ordering"
msgstr "Gmsh / VTK ↔ TensorMesh 节点编号"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:201 95974407d8f647e494c9ae2f2f7f7a17
msgid ""
"``examples/basics/element_gallery.py`` puts TensorMesh's internal node "
"numbering side-by-side with the Gmsh / VTK convention, for 2D and 3D "
"elements at orders 2–4. The output is a two-row plot per element type: "
"top row is the TensorMesh / FEniCS-style ordering; bottom row is the Gmsh"
" / VTK ordering."
msgstr ""
"``examples/basics/element_gallery.py`` 将 TensorMesh 的内部节点编号与 Gmsh / VTK "
"约定并排展示，覆盖 2–4 阶的二维和三维单元。输出为每种单元类型一幅两行图：上一行是 TensorMesh / FEniCS "
"风格的编号；下一行是 Gmsh / VTK 编号。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:207 d7d72d54e7e74cca8484b7e0db2c1493
msgid ""
"This is the visual companion to the ``reorder=True`` story in "
":doc:`../user_guide/meshes`: when you load a Gmsh ``.msh`` or write a VTU"
" through meshio, TensorMesh applies the inverse permutation returned by "
"``element.get_gmsh_permutation(order)`` so internal connectivity always "
"uses the same convention. If you ever question which numbering a "
"particular array is in, this script makes it obvious."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../user_guide/meshes` 中关于 ``reorder=True`` 的内容由本脚本提供可视化配套说明：当你加载 "
"Gmsh 的 ``.msh`` 文件或通过 meshio 写出 VTU 时，TensorMesh 会施加 "
"``element.get_gmsh_permutation(order)`` "
"返回的逆置换，从而使内部连接性始终采用同一约定。如果你不确定某个数组采用的是哪种编号，这个脚本能让答案一目了然。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:215 ed6139f7257c4599ae68a30b519fe26f
msgid ""
"Four representative comparisons are shown below — one per element family."
" The remaining element types (line, prism, pyramid) follow the same two-"
"row layout; the full set lives in "
"``examples/basics/output/element_gallery/``."
msgstr ""
"下面展示了四个代表性对比——每个单元族一个。其余单元类型（线、三棱柱、四棱锥）采用相同的两行布局；完整集合位于 "
"``examples/basics/output/element_gallery/``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:220 23ae3b665b164389a29fdeb60eacff1f
msgid "Triangle node ordering, TensorMesh vs Gmsh/VTK, orders 2-4"
msgstr "三角形节点编号，TensorMesh 与 Gmsh/VTK 对比，2-4 阶"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:224 68c8d81143c24d8393b41d9a54339eee
msgid ""
"``Triangle`` — top row: TensorMesh / FEniCS ordering; bottom row: Gmsh / "
"VTK ordering."
msgstr "``Triangle``——上一行：TensorMesh / FEniCS 编号；下一行：Gmsh / VTK 编号。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:227 72494100513246228ad67c7fffeeb450
msgid "Quadrilateral node ordering, TensorMesh vs Gmsh/VTK, orders 2-4"
msgstr "四边形节点编号，TensorMesh 与 Gmsh/VTK 对比，2-4 阶"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:231 91409f44b27147819f485569d901d073
msgid ""
"``Quadrilateral`` — note that the TensorMesh layout is lexicographic, "
"while Gmsh's order-3 / order-4 quad layouts spiral around the boundary."
msgstr ""
"``Quadrilateral``——注意 TensorMesh 的布局是字典序的，而 Gmsh 的 3 阶 / 4 "
"阶四边形布局是沿边界螺旋排列的。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:235 162a09ab14ee451cab5bdf26ad7fa014
msgid "Tetrahedron node ordering, TensorMesh vs Gmsh/VTK, orders 2-4"
msgstr "四面体节点编号，TensorMesh 与 Gmsh/VTK 对比，2-4 阶"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:239 c4e0fdbaa277439491eeae34849b45ea
msgid ""
"``Tetrahedron`` — vertex / edge / face / interior groupings are preserved"
" across both orderings, only the indices within each group differ."
msgstr "``Tetrahedron``——顶点 / 边 / 面 / 内部的分组在两种编号下都保持一致，仅各组内的索引有所不同。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:243 10dece500c8743c7a1e3a434238cb2a4
msgid "Hexahedron node ordering, TensorMesh vs Gmsh/VTK, orders 2-4"
msgstr "六面体节点编号，TensorMesh 与 Gmsh/VTK 对比，2-4 阶"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:247 168a4d3d1d2e47b99ba7ad5b80e98cd0
msgid ""
"``Hexahedron`` — the largest discrepancy in the gallery, since Gmsh's hex"
" ordering walks along edges while TensorMesh's is plain lexicographic."
msgstr "``Hexahedron``——本画廊中差异最大的情形，因为 Gmsh 的六面体编号沿边游走，而 TensorMesh 的是单纯的字典序。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:255 67cff95869224440bfde07466bb671ce
msgid "Mesh generation gallery"
msgstr "网格生成画廊"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:257 72839293dd6a4257900fa3fb15082d2b
msgid ""
"``examples/basics/plot_mesh.py`` is the picture catalog of what "
"TensorMesh's mesh tools can produce, plus a few visualization helpers "
"from :mod:`tensormesh.visualization`:"
msgstr ""
"``examples/basics/plot_mesh.py`` 是 TensorMesh 网格工具产物的图册，并附带 "
":mod:`tensormesh.visualization` 中的几个可视化辅助函数："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:261 b5ce15b4058340819abae4a5013c4d4a
msgid ""
"**Built-in primitives** — rectangle (triangle and quadrilateral), cube "
"(tetrahedral and hexahedral, the latter with quadratic basis), and a unit"
" disk via :class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen`."
msgstr ""
"**内置基元**——矩形（三角形和四边形）、立方体（四面体和六面体，后者采用二次基），以及通过 "
":class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` 生成的单位圆盘。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/basics.rst:264 2d9d7ff2ec3b47238478e339974cbde7
msgid ""
"**Hybrid meshes** — half the rectangle is meshed with triangles, the "
"other half with quadrilaterals, and a circular hole is punched in the "
"interface. ``mesh.cells`` is a ``BufferDict`` keyed by element type, so "
"all assemblers iterate over both element types automatically."
msgstr ""
"**混合网格**——矩形一半用三角形剖分，另一半用四边形剖分，并在交界处开了一个圆孔。\\ ``mesh.cells`` 是一个以单元类型为键的 "
